{"id":"hauteur","lemma":"hauteur","pos":"noun","rank":2144,"glosses":["height, altitude","arrogance","height"],"ipa":"/o.tœʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/e6/Fr-hauteur.ogg/Fr-hauteur.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"hauteurs"},"formAudio":{"hauteurs":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/f/f6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-hauteurs.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"À quelle hauteur peux-tu sauter ?","en":"How high can you jump?","words":[{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"which?"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to jump, leap"}]},{"text":"J'ai peur de la hauteur.","en":"I'm scared of heights.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"fear"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"J'ai terriblement peur des hauteurs.","en":"I'm awfully afraid of heights.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"terribly"},{"g":"fear"},{"g":"some / of the","l":"un"},null]},{"text":"T'en sens-tu à la hauteur ?","en":"Do you feel up to it?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"meaning, sense"},{"g":"you"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"Elle était à la hauteur du boulot.","en":"She was equal to the job.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},null,null,null,{"g":"of the / some"},{"g":"work"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"a la"]]}]}